## 📖 Data Catalog for Gold Layer

### 1. `gold.dim_patients`
* **Purpose:** Stores demographic, contact, and insurance profiles for patients.

| Column Name | Data Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| patient_key | INT | Surrogate key uniquely identifying each patient record. |
| patient_id | VARCHAR(50) | Natural business key assigned to the patient. |
| first_name | VARCHAR(50) | The patient's first name. |
| last_name | VARCHAR(50) | The patient's last or family name. |
| full_name | VARCHAR(100) | Concatenated full name of the patient. |
| gender | VARCHAR(20) | Standardized gender of the patient. |
| date_of_birth | DATE | Patient date of birth (YYYY-MM-DD). |
| contact_number | VARCHAR(50) | Phone contact number. |
| address | VARCHAR(255) | Residential address. |
| registration_date | DATE | Registration date in the system. |
| insurance_provider | VARCHAR(100) | Insurance provider company name. |
| insurance_number | VARCHAR(50) | Policy or insurance identification number. |
| email | VARCHAR(100) | Lowercased email address. |

---

### 2. `gold.dim_doctors`
* **Purpose:** Stores physician profiles, medical specializations, and branch locations.

| Column Name | Data Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| doctor_key | INT | Surrogate key uniquely identifying each doctor. |
| doctor_id | VARCHAR(50) | Natural business key assigned to the doctor. |
| first_name | VARCHAR(50) | Doctor's first name. |
| last_name | VARCHAR(50) | Doctor's last name. |
| full_name | VARCHAR(100) | Formatted full name with title (e.g., 'Dr. John Doe'). |
| specialization | VARCHAR(50) | Medical specialty (e.g., 'Pediatrics', 'Oncology'). |
| phone_number | VARCHAR(50) | Work contact number. |
| years_experience | INT | Total years of medical practice. |
| hospital_branch | VARCHAR(100) | Assigned hospital branch location. |
| email | VARCHAR(100) | Professional email address. |

---

### 3. `gold.fact_appointment`
* **Purpose:** Captures operational transactions, appointment statuses, and performed treatments.

| Column Name | Data Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| appointment_key | INT | Primary surrogate key for the fact record. |
| appointment_id | VARCHAR(50) | Natural key identifying the appointment. |
| doctor_key | INT | Foreign key linking to `gold.dim_doctors`. |
| patient_key | INT | Foreign key linking to `gold.dim_patients`. |
| treatment_id | VARCHAR(50) | Identifier for the medical treatment performed. |
| reason_for_visit | VARCHAR(100) | Primary reason for the visit (e.g., 'Checkup', 'Emergency'). |
| treatment_type | VARCHAR(100) | Type of procedure performed (e.g., 'MRI', 'X-Ray'). |
| treatment_description | VARCHAR(255) | Detailed description of the treatment. |
| status | VARCHAR(50) | Appointment status ('Completed', 'No-show', 'Cancelled'). |
| treatment_cost | DECIMAL(10,2) | Cost incurred for the treatment procedure. |
| appointment_date | DATE | Scheduled appointment date. |
| appointment_time | TIME(0) | Exact time of the appointment. |
| treatment_date | DATE | Date when the treatment was performed. |

---

### 4. `gold.fact_billing`
* **Purpose:** Tracks financial billing, collection statuses, and payment methods.

| Column Name | Data Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| bill_key | INT | Primary surrogate key for the financial transaction. |
| bill_id | VARCHAR(50) | Unique invoice identifier. |
| patient_key | INT | Foreign key linking to `gold.dim_patients`. |
| treatment_id | VARCHAR(50) | Associated medical treatment identifier. |
| payment_method | VARCHAR(50) | Channel used ('Credit Card', 'Insurance', 'Cash'). |
| payment_status | VARCHAR(50) | Collection status ('Paid', 'Pending', 'Failed'). |
| amount | DECIMAL(10,2) | Total billed amount. |
| bill_date | DATE | Invoice generation date. |

